<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Straits says completes coal deal.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Straits says completes coal deal.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Copper producer Straits Resources Ltd said on Friday it has completed the US$20.6 million purchase of Straits Sebuku Pte Ltd as part of diversification plans.</p>
<p>The acquisition gives it 80 percent of the Sebuku coal project and a 64 percent interest in the Sungei coal exploration project in Indonesia.</p>
<p>Straits said development of Sebuku, which is expected to produce 1.35 million tonnes of coal a year over its 11 year life, would begin immediately. The first coal shipment was expected in the fourth quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
